 Install BrotherSBE:
 
 ```bash
-claude plugin marketplace add khalilmaaouni/BrotherSBE
+claude plugin marketplace add khalilmaaouni/BrotherSBE@v3.1.0
 claude plugin install brothersbe@brothersbe
 ```
 
+The `@v3.1.0` pins the marketplace to the released tag rather than to a moving
+branch. Leave it off and two people installing on different days get different
+commits, which makes a bug and a version difference look identical. That
+matters most during a pilot, when comparing what different people hit is the
+entire point.
+
